- * default (idle_enter_frames = 0) until the IC-side effect is verified.
+ * Idle sampling.  Process context, so op_lock (and the interrupt quiesce inside
+ * it) may be taken.
+ *
+ * The frame is *not* read here on purpose: reading the event stack outside an
+ * interrupt has no relation to the IC's frame boundary, and the resulting torn
